  {
   "title": "Risques op\u00e9rationnels",
   "category": "operational",
   "severity": 3,
   "score_rationale": "Section Operating Risks au milieu de l'Item 1A (~31%), contrainte presente et non hypothetique : \"Our Expansion Places a Significant Strain on our Management, Operational, Financial, and Other Resources\". Sans chiffrage : 3.",
   "trend": "stable",
   "summary": "Risques op\u00e9rationnels touchant cha\u00eene d'approvisionnement, capital humain, qualit\u00e9 produit ou continuit\u00e9 d'activit\u00e9.",
   "score": 3
  },
  {
   "title": "Pression concurrentielle",
   "category": "competitive",
   "severity": 4,
   "score_rationale": "Tout premier risque de l'Item 1A (~2%) : \"We Face Intense Competition\", avec issue chiffrable en marge (could materially reduce our sales and profits). Position maximale : 4.",
   "trend": "stable",
   "summary": "Pression concurrentielle accrue, \u00e9rosion potentielle des parts de march\u00e9 et compression des marges face \u00e0 de nouveaux entrants.",
   "score": 4
  },
  {
   "title": "Ex\u00e9cution strat\u00e9gique",
